ciousActivity`: No mention of money, rates, or payments for sexual services.\n    *   `Explicit-Flirting`: No requests for nudity, sexual acts, \"dirty talk\", or body measurements. The conversation is about relationship status and boyfriends, which is explicitly listed as \"Allowed\" (talk about relationships, marriage, etc.).\n\n    *   The conversation is entirely \"ordinary conversation\" (greetings, location, age, relationship status).\n    *   None of the categories are triggered.",
